<title>INDIA: India's BSES up 4.06 percent at Bombay bourse.</title>
<headline>India's BSES up 4.06 percent at Bombay bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of power generation and utility firm, Bombay Suburban Electric Supply (BSES) on Monday jumped 9.50 rupees or 4.06 percent, to 243.50 rupees at the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE), dealers said.</p>
<p>They said foreign funds who were looking at Indian shares presently available at &quot;good values&quot; were active buyers in the stock.</p>
<p>Over 449,000 shares of BSES were traded in afternoon deals at the BSE.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
